Verifying and updating
----------------------

The files can be re-fetched from their source URLs above. `go test ./...` in
this module checks that each one still parses and still loads as a schema, but
it deliberately does not fetch: a test that reaches the network would fail for
reasons that have nothing to do with this code, which is the very problem this
module exists to avoid.

If your organisation requires a specific reviewed copy of these schemas, do not
use this module: build the catalog yourself from your own files, which is a few
lines and is what xsd.CatalogResolver, xsd.W3CEntries and AddFromFS are for.
